{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ夕方.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When we reached Zahha, we got out of the car with clear faces.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"See you! Get along, all of you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you very much!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Thanks, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mister</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, thanks for everything!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Still, just in case. Don't let your guard down until April 8 is over. The 'shinigami' may still be aiming at you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">What is certain is that somebody put those paper figures there."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"And one more thing: I have not told </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Niimura-san's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> that you came to the police today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> came to the station on her own and talked on her own. That is all it was, so there is no need to worry about reading </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s face."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
