{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Today <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> had been <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="おび">afraid</STYLE> of the curse, and had shed tears out of the blame she laid on herself over us.
